  "details": "I previously suggested on Canny which  well comfortable change and it marked completed. It was grateful that it was accepted as it was comfortable playing music through the mic.\n\nHowever, Now Im sad because due to the adjustments around the audio, the whispering sounds cut again and pianissimo sounds are intermittent.\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1220need-a-option-to-bypass-the-noise-gate-and-turn-it-off\n\nIt is a necessary function for street musicians and performers. Please revert it.\n\n私は以前、快適な変更を完了したCannyについて提案しました。マイクを通して音楽を流すのが心地よかったので採用されてありがたかったです。\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1220need-a-option-to-bypass-the-noise-gate-and-turn-it-off\n\nただ、オーディオ周りの調整でささやき声がまたカットされたり、ピアニシモの音が途切れたりして悲しいです。\n\nストリートミュージシャンやパフォーマーには必要な機能です。お願いします。元に戻してください。",
